# The Omarchy commit whose plugin validator checks plugin/ where the
# omarchy CLI is absent (CI) and the plugin split in the release workflow
# (WP-190). packaging/omarchy-validate.sh reads this file; it fetches
# bin/omarchy-plugin-validate at `commit` over HTTPS, refuses it unless its
# sha256 is `validator_sha256`, then runs it. The same commit gives CI its
# shell tree (packaging/omarchy-tree.sh, ADR-0055). The pin is the release
# Omarchy stable ships (E93): its validator and tree equal the stable
# `omarchy` package's; it never replaces an installed tree as the
# reference (AGENTS.md §1). packaging/README.md, "The Omarchy pin", says
# how to refresh it.
#
# The repository moved from basecamp/omarchy (the name the installed tree
# still gives) to omacom/omarchy: github.com/basecamp/omarchy answers 301
# to omacom/omarchy, same repository id 994093166 (checked 2026-10-09).
#
# Omarchy 4.0.4 (tag v4.0.4; `omarchy version` 4.0.4-1 on the test host
# and the dev host, 2026-10-09, same validator sha256; the stable package
# omarchy-4.0.4-1, sha256 78fa778d…, has the same validator and the same
# shell tree digest, 2026-10-13)
